   48+7162              ; Logical HL in 0..#FFFE -> physical HL, map one of four data banks.
   49+7162              ; DE and AF changed. Bank 4 alone leaves the entire FTP directory intact.
   50+7162              text_map:
   51+7162 E5                   push    hl
   52+7163 7C                   ld      a,h
   53+7164 07                   rlca
   54+7165 07                   rlca
