 8718+835F              ; data_available_in_module_file:
 8719+835F              ; NZ/NC = HL available data (clamped to download_length).
 8720+835F              ; Z/NC = closed socket with no queued bytes; Z/C = user pressed B.
 8721+835F              ; Temporary emptiness is paced and retried, never treated as EOF.
 8722+835F              ; Empty polls wait until data, confirmed closure or B; AT query replies remain bounded.
 8723+835F              ; Changes AF/BC/DE/HL. Directory polling above keeps its own completion policy.
 8724+835F              data_available_in_module_file
 8725+835F              .file_wait:
